
### Hämta alla uppgifter (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Hämta uppgift (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Skapa uppgift (201 Created, 400 Bad Request <> 422 Unprocessable content)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Städa"
}

### Radera uppgift (204 No Content, 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/tasks/2
Accept: application/json
